{"ts": 1791258485.222859, "type": "step", "step": 19, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You\u2019re on the right track. For the eval section, don\u2019t just say \u201cI tested it\u201d \u2014 say **what counts as success** and **how many seeds succeeded**.\n\nA simple template you can paste:\n\n**Evaluation**\n- I evaluated the build on 3 random seeds.\n- Success means the environment is defined clearly enough that the agent can act from the given state/observations/actions, and the run completes without breaking.\n- I report **pass^3**: all 3 runs must succeed.\n- Results: seed 1 __, seed 2 __, seed 3 __.\n- Overall: __/3 successful runs.\n\nIf you want, I can help you turn your exact experiments into a polished paragraph.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-eval"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok\n[activity] t=4 messages 4m", "t": 8, "activity": [{"t": 4, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.296727034588242, "pomdp": 0.32206964178034575, "pass_k": 0.3702278015309615}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.6327447761339733, "motivation": 0.44783718433757524, "reliance": 0.3129446126246264, "persistence": 0.4671650147483821, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.28910681059556054, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.3019095011780912, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
